OHOS: standard Movies/Documents paths may sit outside the sandbox, so add an
AppDataLocation fallback directory; a real temp-file create/close/delete
probe is more reliable here than checking permission bits, and the probe
walks up through not-yet-created subdirectories to find an authorizable
parent rather than treating a future subdirectory that does not exist yet as
proof the whole tree is unwritable.

